# config (six review runs): Borg config options other than cheat death.
# Each run rewrites one option of the stock borg.txt (harness/run.sh config
# flags) and uses the birth menu's real letters (flag "menu") and Borg cheat
# death.
#
# This is the `config` suite without its seventh run, the 1,000,000-turn
# `cfg-lunal-deep-warrior` case: on a two-core sandbox that run alone costs
# about two hours per role. The six runs below are the ones the second
# external review (REVIEW-821cad310) ran by hand: munchkin start and lunal
# mode, each with the same three characters. Blackguard munchkin is slow
# (about 137k keys by turn 20k), so its runs stop at 20k game turns.
#
# Used by the v12R validation (docs/validation/2026-11-13-c-v12r); the full
# seven-run suite is harness/suites/config.
# NAME                    SEED   RACE CLASS TURNS   FLAGS
# borg_munchkin_start = TRUE
cfg-munchkin-human-war    42     0    0     100000  menu,cheat,munchkin
cfg-munchkin-halfelf-mage 12345  1    1     100000  menu,cheat,munchkin
cfg-munchkin-dunadan-bg   1080   8    8     20000   menu,cheat,munchkin
